            "line": 132,
            "text": "theorem fall_of_cert (hD : D.Admissible)\n    (h : IsTrajectory D u v a b) (h0 : v a ∈ D.Safe) {c : ℝ} {cs : List ℝ} {τ : ℝ}\n    (hcert : D.ValidFallCert c cs τ)\n    {s e : ℝ} (hs : a ≤ s) (he : e ≤ b) (hu : ∀ t ∈ Ico s e, D.VIH ≤ u t) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc s e, s + τ ≤ t → v t ≤ D.VOL := by"
